[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver/tests/semver_solver_impl_test.py: Initialized unit test suite for semver_solver_impl with package-qualified semver_solver.lib imports and lifecycle phase scoping. Covers VersionEngine parse/compare/parse_range/satisfies (caret, tilde, wildcard, hyphen, union, prerelease filtering), PackageRepository registration/descending retrieval/copy/missing-package errors, and DependencySolver highest-version selection, backtracking, and ResolutionConflictError reporting including unregistered packages.
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver/lib/semver_solver.py: Implemented SemVer interface module: non-frozen dataclass exception hierarchy with message rendering, frozen data types (Version/VersionRange/PackageDependency/PackageRelease/ResolutionOutcome) with canonical format/is_prerelease/str implementations, and @poly_type protocol stubs with @operation members.
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver/lib/semver_solver_impl.py: Implemented SemVer engine, repository, and backtracking solver: strict grammar parsing with leading-zero rejection, full SemVer precedence comparison, range compiler supporting comparators/caret/tilde/wildcards/hyphen/union with trimming and strict validation, prerelease-aware satisfies, descending-precedence release index, and MRV depth-first dependency resolution raising ResolutionConflictError with derivation and conflicting packages.
